# 0014 section 10.7 (ah): the checks of the band correction, 2026-10-27

The sections dated 2026-10-27 are the runs as they gave them, on the band then served, 0.77 to 1.18
(their test names say so). Since 2026-10-28 (the third addendum to (ah), round 19) the band is 0.77 to
1.13; the last section re-runs every planted error on that code.

## The new tests of tests/base/compiled-curve.test.ts on the code before (ah) (main, 5ba98ff): three fail, as they should

× TN 2360's body alone at Mach 1.5 and 2.0: TN 3819 fig. 33 (two readings), fig. 35's no-fin tunnel symbol (three) 39ms
× RM L52J21a's unfinned bodies (figs. 31 to 33 (d)), every nose and both readings, the radome at M 1.62 among them 1ms
× TR 1051 fig. 23(b), the thinnest sting (d/h 0.35), both readings, at M 1.5, 2.0 and 2.9 13ms
