AssertionError: RM L52J21a radome, w1 first: M 1.62, P_B -0.1338, served 0.1371 to 0.1806: expected 0.1338 to be greater than or equal to 0.13712499298058312
AssertionError: TR 1051 fig. 23(b): M 2.9, P_B -0.115, served 0.0818 to 0.1085: expected 0.115 to be less than or equal to 0.10847901763751049
Tests  3 failed | 2 passed | 21 skipped (26)

## Errors planted one at a time in the corrected code (restored after each): every one caught

no-body-alone: no body-alone set (the band as before); no-l52j21a: RM L52J21a left out;
no-tn2360-tr1051: TN 2360 and TR 1051 left out; served-curve-only: the envelope over the served curve
only; tr1051-misread: TR 1051 audit at M 2.9 typed -0.108 for -0.118; w2-low-stale: W2 low end 0.82;
served-band-stale: bodyBaseDrag's high end 1.08 while the band says 1.18.

