## After the review of 2026-10-27: the new tests, each with an error planted in the code it guards: every one caught

l52-other-r-left-out: the fourteen RM L52J21a pairs outside W1's window dropped from the band again;
l52-other-r-misread: round 7's 32-T1 typed -0.1529 for -0.1519; band-text-stale: the page's body base band
text left at "curve 0.82 to 1.08"; label-opened: the curve's label saying "opened" again;
w2-label-no-source: W2's label without its low end's source.

