## 2026-10-28, round 19 applied (the third addendum to (ah)): every planted error, old and new, on the code with 0.77 to 1.13: every one caught

The earlier plants as before, retargeted where the code moved: no-l52j21a drops every RM L52J21a pair;
tr1051-misread types round 19's reader B at M 2.9 as -0.1172 for -0.1127; served-band-stale holds
bodyBaseDrag's high end at 1.08 while the band says 1.13. New: tr1051-faired-back: the M 2.9 symbol's
reader B replaced by the audit's faired -0.118; tr1051-widened: TR 1051's reader B taken less its
reading error (the envelope widened); claim-stale: the validated claim's BRL 934 tolerances left at
1.18's (+30.7% to +31.4%); gate-caption-stale: the gate table's caption left at +26.8% to +31.6%;
brl-caption-stale: BRL 934's table caption left at +30.7% to +31.4%.

